Remember a wrong guess the moment it fails. Recall before you guess.
Fires by itself with :when "situation", judged by meaning before every step, or :on (kind pattern) for an exact event: call, result, error, step, prose, user, recall, start.
Signatures, examples, rules: memory/recall "memory/writing", or its trigger.
